{"agent":"sw-remoteauth","data":{"alternatives":"A new [serve] section (waits on the _core.py queue, splits roles from their verbs). Role-to-verb table (names every role twice). Require a token by default (breaks every existing terminal flow, against r-safe-by-default).","consequences":"Agent-recorded, not operator-chosen: the operator may supersede any item. Until require_operator_token is on, a marker-free shell still counts as a person.","context":"P-remote.auth names roles, ttl and per-role verbs as config. D-remote fixes the roles, not these defaults. The planned config_sections/serve.py needed config/_core.py, a hub file queued three deep; [agent] needs no hub edit and is where roles and ask codes already are.","decided_by":"","decision":"(1) Token knobs are [agent] knobs, beside roles and ask_code_length, not a new [serve] section; [serve] stays for bind, port and limits (P-remote.serve). (2) [agent].require_operator_token ships off (r-safe-by-default). (3) The hash store is the user-level dir and its path is no knob. (4) pair, tokens rotate and revoke are T3, CLI only, listed in sites.TERMINAL_ONLY. (5) Per-role verb lists are [agent].roles read with [agent].capability_verbs, deny by default.","globs":["ddflow/services/auth.py","ddflow/config_sections/agent.py"],"item":"P-remote.auth","saw":["D-rule-dedupe-everywhere","D-trigger-cap-knob","D-everything-configurable","D-remote","D-small-files","D-universal-principles","D-shared-engines-r2","D-ai-import","D-constellation","D-platform-mcp","D-stack-tools","D-acp-r2","D-model-routing","D-company-workflows","D-file-ddflow-defects","D-ddflow-self-assessment-r2","D-config-engine","D-merge-order-warn-r2","D-unify-r2","D-compat-r2","D-config-layer-order","D-jinja-trust-reaffirmed","D-written-defaults-are-marked","D-no-shell-principle","D-small-files-30k","D-reviewer-independence-soft","D-rules-expansion-2026-11","D-external-frontends","D-reimpl-answers"],"sources":[],"status":"accepted","supersedes":[],"tags":["auth","security"],"title":"Paired tokens: knobs live in [agent] beside the roles, proof stays opt-in, store path is no knob"},"id":"efb493efa05658150adb355f3","kind":"decision.recorded","lamport":139618,"schema":1,"subject":"D-auth-token-defaults","ts":"2026-11-05T12:48:25.995846Z"}
